{"caption":"","data":"unsolved goals\nd : ℕ\nA : ElectromagneticPotential d\n𝓕 : FreeSpace\nhA : ContDiff ℝ ∞ A.val\nJ : LorentzCurrentDensity d\nhJ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ J\nh : IsExtrema 𝓕 A J\nt : Time\nx : Space d\ni : Fin d\nhEcd : ∀ (k : Fin d), ContDiff ℝ 2 fun y => (electricField 𝓕.c A t y).ofLp k\nhEsd : ∀ (k j : Fin d), Differentiable ℝ (Space.deriv j fun y => (electricField 𝓕.c A t y).ofLp k)\nhρd : Differentiable ℝ fun y => LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t y\nhdiv :\n  (fun y => ∑ j, Space.deriv j (fun x => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp j) y) = fun y =>\n    LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t y / 𝓕.ε₀\nhcross :\n  ∑ j, Space.deriv j (Space.deriv i fun x => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp j) x =\n    𝓕.ε₀⁻¹ * Space.deriv i (fun x => LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x) x\n⊢ ∂ₜ (∂ₜ fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) t =\n    𝓕.c.val ^ 2 * ∑ j, Space.deriv j (Space.deriv j fun x => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp i) x -\n        𝓕.c.val ^ 2 / 𝓕.ε₀ * Space.deriv i (fun x => LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x) x -\n      𝓕.c.val ^ 2 * 𝓕.μ₀ * ∂ₜ (fun x_1 => (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J x_1 x).ofLp i) t","endPos":{"column":20,"line":431},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/revalidation/P5/e8aa76c19de863168aef2013a3f2ad07f271f333d16606279d8712316582d43e-candidate/physlib-v4.32.0/fresh/lean/002_saved_candidate/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"Tactic.unsolvedGoals","pos":{"column":60,"line":384},"severity":"error"}
{"caption":"","data":"Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.time_deriv_time_deriv_electricField_of_isExtrema {d : ℕ}\n  {A : Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential d} {𝓕 : Electromagnetism.FreeSpace} (hA : ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) A.val)\n  (J : Electromagnetism.LorentzCurrentDensity d) (hJ : ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) J)\n  (h : Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.IsExtrema 𝓕 A J) (t : Time) (x : Space d) (i : Fin d) :\n  Time.deriv (Time.deriv fun x_1 => (Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) t =\n    𝓕.c.val ^ 2 *\n          ∑ j,\n            Space.deriv j\n              (Space.deriv j fun x => (Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp i) x -\n        𝓕.c.val ^ 2 / 𝓕.ε₀ * Space.deriv i (fun x => Electromagnetism.LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x) x -\n      𝓕.c.val ^ 2 * 𝓕.μ₀ *\n        Time.deriv (fun x_1 => (Electromagnetism.LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J x_1 x).ofLp i) t","endPos":{"column":6,"line":437},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/revalidation/P5/e8aa76c19de863168aef2013a3f2ad07f271f333d16606279d8712316582d43e-candidate/physlib-v4.32.0/fresh/lean/002_saved_candidate/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":437},"severity":"information"}
